<title>USA: American Exploration high bidder on 2 blocks.</title>
<headline>American Exploration high bidder on 2 blocks.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Exploration Co said Thursday it was the high bidder for two blocks in the Gulf of Mexico federal lease sale.</p>
<p>The blocks, Brazos 474 and Mustang Island A-139, are located in shallow waters, offshore Texas, the company said.</p>
<p>American bid as a 100 percent participant in Brazos Block 474 and a 45 percent participant in Mustang Island Block A-139. Its net bid was $590,000.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
